    "# NYC Shootings Cluster Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## Project Overview\n",
    "This project develops a machine learning model to cluster shooting incidents in New York City based on relevant attributes such as occurrence date/time, location, demographic information, and jurisdiction. The goal is to identify patterns and clusters that can inform law enforcement strategies and resource allocation.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Deliverables\n",
    "1. Data Preprocessing & Feature Engineering\n",
    "2. Clustering Model Development & Comparison\n",
    "3. Visualization of Geographic Patterns\n",
    "4. Actionable Recommendations for Law Enforcement\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. ENVIRONMENT SETUP & IMPORTS"
